+ *
+ *    - MIG_EVENT_SETUP [-> MIG_EVENT_POSTCOPY_START] -> MIG_EVENT_DONE
+ *    - MIG_EVENT_SETUP [-> MIG_EVENT_POSTCOPY_START] -> MIG_EVENT_FAILED
+ *    - MIG_EVENT_FAILED
